   "id": "92c9451d-10cd-4e56-bb0e-43df951bf25c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Initialize Earth Engine; if it raises, run `ee.Authenticate()` once and re-initialize.Do this a single time per kernel/session."
